<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's KFA seeks up to 35,000T of soymeal.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's KFA seeks up to 35,000T of soymeal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korea Feed Association has invited tenders to buy 30,000 to 35,000 tonnes of soymeal by 5:00 p.m. (0800 GMT) on Thursday, traders said.  </p>
<p>Traders said arrival was set for October 20 to the western port of Inchon.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for August 22-September 10 if sourced from South America or the United States, for September 16-October 5 if from India, or October 1-20 if from China.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
